nser, Thomas Norton, Thomas Sackville.\r\nOthers: Caedmon, Cynewulf, Roger Bacon, William Langland, Alfred the Great, Venerable Bede, Sir Philip Sidney, Francis Bacon, John Milton, John Bunyan, John Dryden, John Locke, Alexander Pope, Jonathan Swift, Daniel Defoe, Henry Fielding, Samuel Johnson, Thomas Gray, Edmund Burke, Nicholas Udall, Beaumont and Fletcher, George Chapman, John Webster, Cyril Tourneur, Henry Vaughan, Thomas Hobbes, Jeremy Taylor, Samuel Butler, William Congreve, George Farquhar, Edmund Waller, Samuel Richardson, Oliver Goldsmith, Edward Gibbon.\r\nসোর্সঃ যেকোনো গাইড বই, An ABC OF English Literature - Dr. M. Mofizar Rahman\r\n[এই পরীক্ষা থেকে পড়া শুরু করলে আগামী ১৫০ দিনে বিসিএসের সম্পূর্ণ সিলেবাস কাভার হবে।]","study_content":[],"is_omr":false,"omr_time":"02 ঘণ্টা 00 মিনিট","slug":"2344889-2675","is_live_attened":false,"is_archive_attened":false,"is_question_checked":false,"mark":"50","examtime_int":17,"omrtime_int":120,"study_material_count":0,"is_study_material":false,"subject_id":14,"subject_name":"১৪০ দিনে ৫২তম বিসিএস প্রস্তুতি","date_str":"Jun 17, 2021"}],"num_pages":774,"total_items":15469,"current_page":658,"total_page":23,"has_previous":true,"has_next":true,"previous_page_number":657,"next_page_number":659,"pagination":{"current_page":658,"page_size":20,"total_pages":774,"total_results":15469,"has_next":true,"has_previous":true,"next_page":659,"previous_page":657}}}